{"src":"en","tgt":"fa","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fa","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7945.532064,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8694.316428999999,"text":"با این حال، منطقه شنژن از این نظر تا حدی شبیه به یک کشور عمل می‌کند."},{"kind":"audio","t":8807.108681000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8811.774245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8817.073058000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8817.754957000001,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":15115.700897000002,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15931.407726000001,"text":"این غار که بر فراز یکی از کوه‌های شمال مکه قرار دارد، به‌طور نزدیکی"},{"kind":"audio","t":16027.920865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16033.044472000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16038.500362000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16039.125362000002,"samples":7300,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":17735.431287,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18050.949569,"text":"از بقیه جهان جداست."},{"kind":"audio","t":18087.084367,"samples":29257,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1210},{"kind":"input","t":26297.780357,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27463.130319,"text":"مردم اکنون پیام‌ها را روی صفحه‌های کامپیوتر می‌نویسند و هرگز نیازی ندارند که به تراش نزدیک شوند."},{"kind":"audio","t":27587.376653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27592.671477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":27597.873742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27603.191924000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27606.670787,"samples":22736,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":37544.519057,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39455.529245,"text":"مسافرانی که عازم کشورهایی با مالیات‌های سنگین هستند، گاهی می‌توانند مقدار قابل توجهی پول پس‌انداز کنند، به‌ویژه در مورد محصولاتی مانند نوشیدنی‌های الکلی و تنباکو."},{"kind":"audio","t":39659.026092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39664.221547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39669.671917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39674.921832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39680.284354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39685.513098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39690.721933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39694.062408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39694.501241,"samples":10086,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":45788.696629,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46619.311614,"text":"گیاهان غذای خود را از طریق فتوسنتز از خورشید می‌سازند. آن‌ها سایه هم ایجاد می‌کنند."},{"kind":"audio","t":46697.919206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46703.366537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46706.159141000004,"samples":19448,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":46711.767249000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46712.487887,"samples":8470,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":58074.568778,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59312.777066,"text":"بیمارستان پروتکل کنترل عفونت را رعایت کرده است، از جمله جداسازی بیمار از دیگران برای جلوگیری از احتمال عفونی شدن سایرین."},{"kind":"audio","t":59468.492715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59473.850987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59479.566404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59485.121573000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59490.708461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59496.385208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59498.175109,"samples":12928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":68187.83302399999,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69320.52096099999,"text":"کار انجام شده عمدتاً تئوری بود، اما برنامه برای شبیه‌سازی مشاهدات صورت گرفته از کهکشان Sagittarius نوشته شد."},{"kind":"audio","t":69458.005159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69463.071486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69468.634375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69474.26741199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69479.537176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69481.656081,"samples":14210,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":78313.23982199999,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79735.83236,"text":"زبان‌های رسمی بارسلونا کاتالان و اسپانیایی هستند. حدود نیمی از آن‌ها ترجیح می‌دهند به زبان کاتالان صحبت کنند، اکثریت قاطع آن را می‌فهمند و تقریباً همه اسپانیایی بلدند."},{"kind":"audio","t":79826.958137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79832.158572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":79835.56499599999,"samples":21678,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":79921.784944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79927.27563399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79933.44677299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":79939.01998099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79942.45855499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79946.024517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79946.25412299999,"samples":2061,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":83791.51075799999,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84800.25131499999,"text":"در برخی مناطق، جوشاندن آب به مدت یک دقیقه کافی است و در برخی دیگر، چندین دقیقه زمان لازم است."},{"kind":"audio","t":84931.890009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84937.04778499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84942.41183699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84947.75545899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84952.032329,"samples":26916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":89863.290104,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90999.116939,"text":"گیاهان در محیط طبیعی خود در زیباترین حالت هستند، بنابراین در برابر وسوسه برداشتن حتی یک ساقه مقاومت کنید."},{"kind":"audio","t":91139.256373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91145.172396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91151.47966299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91157.71122099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91164.49359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91167.41753199999,"samples":14767,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":97274.97910099999,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98408.10182099999,"text":"در طول دهه ۱۹۲۰، نگرش غالب اکثر شهروندان و ملت‌ها، صلح‌طلبی و انزواگرایی بود."},{"kind":"audio","t":98539.29811199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98544.54883599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98549.91357799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98553.52053899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98554.83004799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98555.28911999999,"samples":6687,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":103529.737839,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104628.941534,"text":"ماسا سریف شکارچی رأس هرم زمان خود بود، بنابراین از هیچ‌چیز جز سایر موزول‌ها نمی‌ترسید."},{"kind":"audio","t":104740.163923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104746.276772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":104752.991652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104759.19175099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104760.20668399999,"samples":7968,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":113141.633598,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114454.55649199999,"text":"از زمان تأسیس آسونسیون در سال ۱۵۳۷، پاراگوی موفق شده است بخش زیادی از ویژگی‌ها و هویت بومی خود را حفظ کند."},{"kind":"audio","t":114617.63173099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114622.74326799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":114628.09861999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114633.487962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":114638.729566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114644.201456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114647.42210299999,"samples":22123,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":119871.26977799999,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120731.30803799999,"text":"این بیماری توسط خوک‌ها منتقل می‌شود و سپس از طریق پشه‌ها به انسان‌ها سرایت می‌کند."},{"kind":"audio","t":120842.624128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120847.46015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":120852.64151599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120857.9387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120858.741866,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":129361.290104,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130458.77493300001,"text":"بیشتر تلسکوپ‌های پژوهشی مدرن، تأسیساتی عظیم در مناطق دورافتاده با شرایط جوی مساعد هستند."},{"kind":"audio","t":130578.020675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130582.94536499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130588.80103999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130596.535764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130601.44317399999,"samples":23015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"input","t":135223.681648,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136072.104506,"text":"ممکن است مردم پیش‌بینی نکنند که صبر و درک نیز برای مسافران ضروری است."},{"kind":"audio","t":136167.96976799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136174.356004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":136180.56882299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136182.445493,"samples":12873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":140544.07754199998,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141282.917992,"text":"بنابراین احتمالاً این علامت صرفاً به عنوان یک برچسب اضافه شده است."},{"kind":"audio","t":141369.30759799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141374.350786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141379.62918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141379.950055,"samples":891,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":147773.964277,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148752.844285,"text":"اما هنوز چیزهای زیادی در مورد پرندگان وجود دارد که شبیه به دایناسورها به نظر می‌رسد."},{"kind":"audio","t":148860.43404599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148865.275737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148870.465483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148875.735437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148876.127271,"samples":4625,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":154959.10154,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155943.314371,"text":"تقریباً همگی آن‌ها سواحل شنی با امکان شنای ایمن هستند و بیشترشان سایبانی دارند که توسط..."},{"kind":"audio","t":156064.475661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":156069.256704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156074.561077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":156079.97623899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156083.800257,"samples":24966,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":157898.820733,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158353.99022399998,"text":"درختان پوهیکان فراهم شده است."},{"kind":"audio","t":158399.28333799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158399.51302399999,"samples":13486,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":164348.023079,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165549.410189,"text":"دووال که متاهل است و دو فرزند بالغ دارد، تأثیر چندانی روی میلر، که داستان برایش تعریف شده بود، نگذاشت."},{"kind":"audio","t":165679.91143799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165684.761159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":165690.21361099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165695.372977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165700.875117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165701.267501,"samples":5015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"close","t":175